    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d534-a7">

                <pb facs="0516" n="418" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg418"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of Foreign
                            Affairs to Mr. Swenson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-01-26"><hi rendition="#italic">January 26,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: Referring to the note which you
                    were good enough to address to me on the 9th instant relative to Mr. Thomas P.
                    Jensen and Mr. Charles C. Rönnow, Mormon missionaries, I have the honor to
                    transmit herewith a copy of a letter from my colleague, the minister of justice.
                    It appears that the decree of expulsion against the above persons is in
                    conformity with the Danish laws and the practice heretofore followed in Denmark,
                    and that His Majesty’s Government regrets that it does not find sufficient
                    reason for modifying this practice.</p>
                <p>Be pleased to accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">N. F. Ravn.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
